  {
    "table": "generator",
    "name": "random_decorated",
    "params_schema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "kind=random_decorated：用高基数随机生成器作为内容，前后各加 head/tail，并以 separator 拼接。\n\n用途：例如把一个 random_str 生成为 \"BL-a3kP-CN\"，避免在 body 模板里反复做\n'${var.head}-${var.inner}-${var.tail}' 之类的字符串拼接；以及让\nbl_no / order_no 这类业务编号\"看一眼就能猜到结构\"。\n\n行为：\n  - 若 head / tail 都为空（或未传）→ 等价于 random_str(charset, length)\n  - 否则输出：head + sep + 随机内容 + sep + tail\n  - separator 缺省为空串（直接拼接）；显式传 \"\" 也走同一语义\n\n兼容性：\n  - extra='forbid' 仍然生效\n  - 不传 head/tail → 返回 str，行为退化为普通 random_str",
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "const": "random_decorated",
          "default": "random_decorated",
          "title": "Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "length": {
          "default": 8,
          "description": "随机核心长度",
          "maximum": 1024,
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "Length",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "charset": {
          "default": "alnum",
          "description": "核心字符集",
          "enum": [
            "alpha",
            "digit",
            "alnum"
          ],
          "title": "Charset",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "head": {
          "default": "",
          "description": "前置装饰串；可空",
          "title": "Head",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "tail": {
          "default": "",
          "description": "后置装饰串；可空",
          "title": "Tail",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "separator": {
          "default": "",
          "description": "连接符；缺省直接拼接",
          "title": "Separator",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "title": "RandomDecoratedSpec",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  {
    "table": "generator",
    "name": "time_offset",
    "params_schema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "kind=time_offset：当前 unix 时间 + 单位化偏移量（输出恒为 int 秒）。\n\n设计目的：\n  - 现存 timestamp(offset_seconds=...) 只支持秒级，且需要心算换算\n  - 新 spec 让用户用业务自然语言写偏移量（30 天 / 2 小时 / 500 毫秒）\n  - 输出固定为 unix 秒（int），不参与字符串格式化\n\n字段语义：\n  - unit        时间单位，含 \"milliseconds\" 以便对接毫秒时间戳（如 JS / 日志）\n  - value       偏移量（int，非零），正数=未来 负数=过去（与 direction 互斥共识方向）\n  - direction   仅作为可读性标识，不影响未来/过去的换算结果\n\nExamples::\n\n    # 30 天后（1755071025 这种 int 秒）\n    {\"kind\":\"time_offset\",\"unit\":\"days\",\"value\":30,\"direction\":\"future\"}\n\n    # 2 小时前\n    {\"kind\":\"time_offset\",\"unit\":\"hours\",\"value\":2,\"direction\":\"past\"}\n\n    # 6 个月后（按日历月，Jan 31 + 6 months = Jul 31）\n    {\"kind\":\"time_offset\",\"unit\":\"months\",\"value\":6,\"direction\":\"future\"}\n\n    # 1 年后（按日历月 = 12 个月，月末日溢出夹到目标月最后一天）\n    {\"kind\":\"time_offset\",\"unit\":\"years\",\"value\":1,\"direction\":\"future\"}\n\n    # 不传 value → 等价于\"现在的 unix 秒\"\n    {\"kind\":\"time_offset\"}",
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "const": "time_offset",
          "default": "time_offset",
          "title": "Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "unit": {
          "default": "seconds",
          "description": "时间单位（含毫秒、月、年）",
          "enum": [
            "milliseconds",
            "seconds",
            "minutes",
            "hours",
            "days",
            "weeks",
            "months",
            "years"
          ],
          "title": "Unit",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "value": {
          "default": 0,
          "description": "偏移量（int；正数=未来/与 direction 共同描述)",
          "title": "Value",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "direction": {
          "default": "future",
